WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.432
The handsome frog glared at Tom.

2
00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:20.354
The fat frog ate lots of flies.

3
00:00:20.355 --> 00:00:26.702
The fierce frogs started to fight.

4
00:00:26.703 --> 00:00:40.051
The shy frog hid under the table.

5
00:00:40.052 --> 00:00:43.949
"Try a kiss," Cat whispered to Tom.

6
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:48.064
"Good idea, Cat!" Tom said.

7
00:00:48.065 --> 00:00:51.012
He turned to Princess Mary.

8
00:00:51.013 --> 00:00:54.607
"A kiss might undo the spell," he said.

9
00:00:54.608 --> 00:00:58.102
"A kiss?" The princess made a face.

10
00:00:58.103 --> 00:01:00.462
The king frowned at her.

11
00:01:00.463 --> 00:01:04.677
"Kiss the princes, Mary!" he yelled.

12
00:01:04.678 --> 00:01:09.432
Tom caught one of the frogs.

13
00:01:09.433 --> 00:01:12.999
Mary kissed it. "Ugh!"

14
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.724
Tom watched the frog.

15
00:01:16.725 --> 00:01:20.417
But the frog stayed a frog!

16
00:01:20.418 --> 00:01:24.125
Dirk laughed loudly.

17
00:01:24.126 --> 00:01:31.644
"Tom will never undo this spell!" he said.

18
00:01:31.645 --> 00:01:36.002
"I will make a potion," Tom said.

19
00:01:36.003 --> 00:01:46.948
He hurried to the Royal Lab.

20
00:01:46.949 --> 00:01:51.798
Tom mixed some things together.

21
00:01:51.799 --> 00:01:54.584
The potion turned black.

22
00:01:54.585 --> 00:02:01.378
Then . . . Boom! The potion exploded!

23
00:02:01.379 --> 00:02:05.483
"Oh no," Tom moaned.

24
00:02:05.484 --> 00:02:09.164
"Those princes will be frogs forever.

25
00:02:09.165 --> 00:02:12.436
I will be put in the Grim Dungeon.

26
00:02:12.437 --> 00:02:17.718
There will be a Royal War!"

27
00:02:17.719 --> 00:02:22.464
"Cat, this is all my fault," Tom said.

28
00:02:22.465 --> 00:02:30.182
Cat rubbed against Tom's hand.

29
00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:33.955
"You have a good heart," she said.

30
00:02:33.956 --> 00:02:37.901
"We can find a way to undo your spell."

31
00:02:37.902 --> 00:02:43.092
Cat licked her paws slowly.

32
00:02:43.093 --> 00:02:47.375
"Hmm . . . ," she said at last.

33
00:02:47.376 --> 00:02:54.859
"I have an idea."

